      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Look for individuals driven by deep-seated philosophical convictions or an unwavering sense of justice, rather than money or ego; these intrinsic motivators are harder to subvert. Select those who are naturally discreet and value competence over recognition, preferring the shadow work. Furthermore, test their loyalties through low-stakes, morally ambiguous decisions where their character can be revealed under pressure. A truly devoted pillar will see the necessity of your long game before you ever fully explain it.",
